          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Take a journey through the epochs in this family-friendly educational experience that invites players to learn about the fascinating prehistoric creatures which inspired ARK: Survival Evolved.\n\nExplore The Island across land, sea and air where you can discover 64 dinosaurs, all based on their real life, prehistoric counterparts. Ride a huge Tyrannosaurus Rex across the beautiful landscape, soar above the tree tops on the back of a Pteranodon, and even glide through the oceans while riding an ancient Megalodon Shark!\n\nUnlock each creature’s Dino Book for fun-filled science facts and illustrations, all voiced by Madeleine Madden (ARK: The Animated Series, The Wheel of Time) as HLN-A. Cap off your adventure with a custom-built base, choosing from a variety of over 30 building pieces unlocked throughout your adventures.\n\nCan you discover all of the Dinosaurs and become the Ultimate Explorer?",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2022",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
